{"name": "Colouring Page Maker", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Colouring Page Maker — MyLLMos™ App Gallery · © 2026 Opticell Ltd\n  Source-available: read it, remix it, run your version inside MyLLM™.\n  Not for redistribution or republication. Terms: https://github.com/TeamDzX/myllm-assets/blob/main/LICENSE\n--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>Colouring Page Maker</title>\n<style>:root{--build-id:\"57b4b7ca62\";color-scheme:light dark;\n  --bg:var(--myllm-bg,#f2f2f7); --surface:var(--myllm-surface,#fff); --ink:var(--myllm-text,#111);\n  --muted:var(--myllm-muted,#8a8a8e); --line:var(--myllm-border,#e3e3e8); --acc:var(--myllm-accent,#0a84ff);\n  --fill:rgba(120,120,128,.12); --h:330; }\n@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){ :root{ --bg:var(--myllm-bg,#000); --surface:var(--myllm-surface,#1c1c1e);\n  --ink:var(--myllm-text,#f2f2f7); --muted:var(--myllm-muted,#8e8e93); --line:var(--myllm-border,#2c2c2e); --fill:rgba(120,120,128,.24); } }\n  *{ margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent; }\n  body{ font-family:var(--myllm-font,-apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif); background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink);\n    max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; min-height:100dvh; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.4;\n    padding:calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-right)) calc(30px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-left)); }\n  svg.i{ width:1.25em; height:1.25em; fill:currentColor; flex-shrink:0; }\n  button{ font:inherit; color:inherit; cursor:pointer; } button:active{ transform:scale(.96); }\n\n  .head{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin:2px 2px 14px; }\n  .tile{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; flex-shrink:0;\n    background:linear-gradient(145deg, hsl(var(--h) 62% 50%), hsl(calc(var(--h) + 40) 58% 28%)); }\n  .head .tile{ width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:13px; font-size:19px; }\n  .head .ht{ flex:1; min-width:0; }\n  h1{ font-size:22px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.01em; }\n  .head p{ font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:1px; }\n  @media (max-width:360px){ h1{ font-size:19px; letter-spacing:-.02em; } .head{ gap:10px; } }\n\n  .card{ background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; padding:14px; margin-bottom:12px; }\n  label{ display:block; font-size:12px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.07em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); margin:0 2px 7px; }\n  input{ width:100%; font:inherit; font-size:16px; padding:12px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); outline:none; }\n  input:focus{ border-color:var(--acc); }\n  .chips{ display:flex; gap:7px; overflow-x:auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; scrollbar-width:none; margin:9px -14px 0; padding:0 14px 2px; }\n  .chips::-webkit-scrollbar{ display:none; }\n  .chip{ flex:0 0 auto; min-height:36px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--bg); border-radius:99px; padding:0 14px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:650; white-space:nowrap; }\n  .go{ width:100%; min-height:50px; margin-top:14px; border:none; border-radius:14px; background:var(--acc); color:#fff; font-size:16px; font-weight:700;\n    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; }\n  .go:disabled{ opacity:.6; }\n  .spin{ width:16px; height:16px; border-radius:50%; border:2.4px solid currentColor; border-right-color:transparent; animation:spin .8s linear infinite; flex-shrink:0; }\n  @keyframes spin{ to{ transform:rotate(360deg); } }\n\n  .page{ background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; padding:10px; }\n  .paper{ background:#fff; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; }\n  .paper img{ width:100%; display:block; }\n  .skel{ aspect-ratio:3/4; border-radius:12px; background:var(--fill); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:10px;\n    color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; font-weight:600; animation:shimmer 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  .skel .tile{ width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:14px; font-size:21px; }\n  @keyframes shimmer{ 50%{ opacity:.55; } }\n  .acts2{ display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:10px; }\n  .acts2 button{ flex:1; min-height:46px; border:none; border-radius:12px; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:700; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:7px;\n    background:var(--fill); color:var(--acc); }\n  .acts2 button:first-child{ background:var(--acc); color:#fff; }\n  .notice{ display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; font-size:14px; line-height:1.45; border-radius:16px; padding:13px 14px; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); }\n  .notice svg{ color:#ff9f0a; margin-top:1px; }\n  .notice .b{ flex:1; }\n  .notice button{ margin-top:10px; min-height:40px; border:none; border-radius:11px; padding:0 14px; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; background:var(--fill); color:var(--acc); display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }\n  .hint{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); text-align:center; margin-top:10px; }\n  [hidden]{ display:none !important; }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .spin{ animation-duration:2.4s; } .skel{ animation:none; } button:active{ transform:none; } }\n</style></head><body>\n<svg width=\"0\" height=\"0\" style=\"position:absolute\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs>\n  <symbol id=\"i-palette\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2.5a9.5 9.5 0 0 0 0 19c1.5 0 2.3-1 2.3-2.2 0-.6-.2-1-.5-1.4-.3-.4-.5-.8-.5-1.3 0-1 .8-1.8 1.8-1.8h2.2a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 4.2-4.2C21.5 6.1 17.2 2.5 12 2.5zM6.8 12.6a1.6 1.6 0 1 1 0-3.2 1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 3.2zm2.8-4a1.6 1.6 0 1 1 0-3.2 1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 3.2zm4.8 0a1.6 1.6 0 1 1 0-3.2 1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 3.2zm2.8 4a1.6 1.6 0 1 1 0-3.2 1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 3.2z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"i-brush\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20.3 3.7a1.6 1.6 0 0 0-2.3 0l-8 8 2.3 2.3 8-8a1.6 1.6 0 0 0 0-2.3zM8.9 13.1c-1.9 0-3.4 1.5-3.4 3.4 0 1.2-.8 2.1-2 2.4 1 1.3 2.6 2 4.2 2 2.6 0 4.6-2 4.6-4.6z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"i-save\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v9.6l3.3-3.3a1 1 0 1 1 1.4 1.4l-5 5a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 0l-5-5a1 1 0 1 1 1.4-1.4l3.3 3.3V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zM4 18a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v.5h14V19a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v1.5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V19a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"i-again\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 5V2.6a.6.6 0 0 0-1-.45L7.2 5.55a.6.6 0 0 0 0 .9L11 9.85a.6.6 0 0 0 1-.45V7a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-5.5 5.5 1 1 0 0 0-2 0A7.5 7.5 0 1 0 12 5z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"i-warn\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9a2 2 0 0 1 3.4 0l8 13.6a2 2 0 0 1-1.7 3H4a2 2 0 0 1-1.7-3zM12 9a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 2 0v-4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1zm0 7.2a1.2 1.2 0 1 0 0 2.4 1.2 1.2 0 0 0 0-2.4z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></symbol>\n</defs></svg>\n\n<div class=\"head\">\n  <div class=\"tile\"><svg class=\"i\"><use href=\"#i-palette\"/></svg></div>\n  <div class=\"ht\"><h1>Colouring Page Maker</h1><p>Printable pages to colour, from a prompt</p></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <label for=\"what\">What should it be?</label>\n  <input id=\"what\" placeholder=\"A friendly dinosaur in a jungle\" autocomplete=\"off\" enterkeyhint=\"go\">\n  <div class=\"chips\" id=\"chips\"></div>\n  <button class=\"go\" id=\"goBtn\" type=\"button\"></button>\n</div>\n<div id=\"out\"></div>\n\n<script>\nfunction el(id){return document.getElementById(id)}\n/* Bridges are looked up when used, never kept: MyLLM can add them after this\n   script has run. */\nfunction haptic(k){if(window.myllmHaptic)try{myllmHaptic(k)}catch(e){}}\nfunction icon(n){return '<svg class=\"i\"><use href=\"#i-'+n+'\"/></svg>'}\nfunction esc(s){return String(s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return{'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c]})}\nvar lastUrl = null;\nvar IDEAS = [\"a friendly dinosaur\",\"a unicorn in a meadow\",\"a race car\",\"a butterfly garden\",\"a space rocket\",\"an underwater reef\",\"a cosy cottage\",\"a dragon\"];\n\nfunction chips(){\n  var c = el('chips');\n  IDEAS.forEach(function(t){\n    var b=document.createElement('button'); b.type='button'; b.className='chip'; b.textContent=t;\n    b.onclick=function(){ haptic('selection'); el('what').value=t; make(); };\n    c.appendChild(b);\n  });\n}\nfunction goBtn(busy){\n  var b=el('goBtn'); b.disabled=!!busy;\n  b.innerHTML = busy ? '<i class=\"spin\"></i><span>Drawing… about 30 seconds</span>' : icon('brush')+'<span>Make my page</span>';\n}\nfunction notice(msg, retry){\n  el('out').innerHTML='<div class=\"notice\">'+icon('warn')+'<div class=\"b\">'+msg+(retry?'<br><button type=\"button\" id=\"retryB\">'+icon('again')+'Try again</button>':'')+'</div></div>';\n  if(retry) el('retryB').onclick=make;\n}\n\nfunction make(){\n  var what = el('what').value.trim();\n  if(!what){ el('what').focus(); return; }\n  var GEN = window.myllmGenerateImage;\n  if(!GEN){ notice('This app needs the latest MyLLM with <b>Settings → Allow apps to use the AI</b> turned on and an image server configured.'); return; }\n  haptic('light');\n  goBtn(true);\n  el('out').innerHTML='<div class=\"page\"><div class=\"skel\"><div class=\"tile\"><svg class=\"i\"><use href=\"#i-brush\"/></svg></div>Drawing your colouring page…</div></div>';\n  var prompt = 'Black and white line-art colouring book page of '+what+'. Bold clean black outlines on a pure white background, no shading, no grey, no colour, simple and friendly, suitable for a child to colour in.';\n  GEN(prompt, {aspect:'portrait'})\n    .then(function(url){\n      lastUrl = url;\n      var div=document.createElement('div'); div.className='page';\n      div.innerHTML='<div class=\"paper\"><img alt=\"colouring page\"></div><div class=\"acts2\">'+\n        '<button type=\"button\" id=\"saveB\">'+icon('save')+'Save to Photos</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"againB\">'+icon('again')+'Another</button></div>'+\n        '<div class=\"hint\">Save it, then print from Photos.</div>';\n      div.querySelector('img').src=url;\n      el('out').innerHTML=''; el('out').appendChild(div);\n      el('saveB').onclick=savePage; el('againB').onclick=make;\n    })\n    .catch(function(e){ notice(esc(e&&e.message?e.message:'Could not make the page'), true); })\n    .then(function(){ goBtn(false); });\n}\n\nfunction savePage(){\n  if(!lastUrl || !window.myllmSaveImage) return;\n  haptic('success');\n  window.myllmSaveImage(lastUrl).catch(function(){});\n}\n\nel('goBtn').onclick=make;\nel('what').addEventListener('keydown',function(e){ if(e.key==='Enter') make(); });\ngoBtn(false); chips();\n</script></body></html>\n"}